      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Okay, I think I figured out the cause for this. It seems like it's most likely to occur for users you were previously in an instance together with in a single VRChat session, but then they go into a private instance either by changing their status to 🟠 or 🔴 after leaving or just going to a private-type instance in general.\n\n~~Steps to Reproduce~~\n\n1. Have User A and User B together in the same VRChat instance.\n\n2. User B leaves the instance.\n\n3. User B immediately does **one** of the following:\n\n   - Changes their status to **Ask Me (Orange)** or **Do Not Disturb (Red)**, **or**\n\n   - Joins any instance that'll be shown as \"in a private instance\" to User A (Invite Only, Invite Plus, etc.).\n\n4. Observe User B's status in the social menu and check if `Offline` displays in their status. If it is the case, the `Request Invite` button should also be gone.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
